        {
          "id": 2225638634,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yes, `gtpcdr_handle` can be NULL and non-NULL. At present moment GTP' dissector verify only wheather `gtpcdr_handle` exists or not. But when I register my dissector by Lua script then dissector didn't handover further processing to my script. It's looks like this option only works with native dissector in C/C++.\n\nThat is why I added option to register subdissector in table. I safe `gtpcdr_handle` for backward compatibility (may be somodody use it). if `gtpcdr_handle` is NULL then search subdissector in table.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7802130,
            "username": "kor44",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Michail Koreshkov",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ac58c1cf28669b2266d879537ba9a78ea9eb061b5d4c9dae8f5cbde161e66043?s=80&d=identicon",
